<title>SINGAPORE: OUB sees 1.91 mln shares crossed.</title>
<headline>OUB sees 1.91 mln shares crossed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 1.91 million Overseas Union Bank Ltd shares were crossed at Singapore $6.40 in early morning trading on Friday, said dealers.</p>
<p>At around 0157 GMT, the stock was being quoted at S$6.35-S$6.45. It last changed hands at S$6.40, up 10 cents over its previous close. Total volume was 1.92 million shares.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
